 "description": "Proof Plan estimates proving compute and onchain verification costs from your own measurements. It checks a per-job latency target and preserves model, input and verification-key hashes. It plans an integration; it does not generate or verify a zero-knowledge proof. No ZK proof generation or cryptographic verification. File hashing verifies bytes only; it is not proof of model correctness. Retrieve proof with fetch or read its example resource to obtain exact inputs. Parameters are processed remotely without application persistence.",
